[[0,1234299,0,3,0,3,"2016-08-16T13:05:21","Rosenkavalier","",[],"","For The First Time, Russian Strategic Bombers Strike ISIS From Iran's Hamadan Air Base","http://www.zerohedge.com/news/2016-08-16/first-time-russian-strategic-bombers-strike-isis-irans-hamadan-air-base","Worldpolitics"],[1,6086836,0,8,0,8,"2016-08-16T13:13:58","TheDude2","",[],"<p>Thanks Obama. Now Russia, China, and Iran are working against us. I can see the billion you gave them is causing them to act in our interests.</p>"],[2,6086878,6086836,6,0,6,"2016-08-16T13:20:20","Rosenkavalier","",[],"<p>It's ridiculous that the deep state is STILL pushing the US into war against Syria and Iran and by proxy Russia. It's possibly the most disastrous idea in the past century.</p>"],[3,6086904,6086878,6,0,6,"2016-08-16T13:24:06","TheDude2","",[],"<p>The US citizens, in no uncertain terms, told Obama they didn't want to go to war with Syria. Yet here we are.</p>\n<p>Not to mention how China is about to cross another &quot;red line&quot; Obama laid down.</p>"],[4,6087092,6086904,1,0,1,"2016-08-16T13:57:37","Rosenkavalier","",[],"<p>It's hard to imagine the arrogance of anyone who thinks there should be a hot war between the US and China. Insane.</p>"]]